        "claim": "readBlockFile treats a dangling CLAUDE.md symlink as an absent file because os.Stat reports not-exist. WriteFile then cannot resolve the link (EvalSymlinks fails), so it renames the temp file over the symlink itself. This replaces the owner's link instead of following it, contrary to the documented behavior of following symbolic links.",
